    AX["Vps1 (Fission Dynamin)"] --> AV
    AV --> AY[Peroxisome Fission]
    AY --> AZ[New Daughter Peroxisomes]
    
    AM --> BA["Post-translational Modifications (PTMs)"]
    BA --> BB[Regulation of Peroxisome Activity/Stability]
    
    BC{Peroxisome Maturation Complete?}
    AB --> BC
    AK --> BC
    AQ --> BC
    AM --> BC
    BC --> BD[Mature Functional Peroxisome]

    AZ --> BD
    BD --> BE[Peroxisomal Metabolic Reactions]
    BE --> BF["Metabolic Products (e.g., Acetyl-CoA, H2O2)"]
    BF --> BG[Cellular Homeostasis]
    BD --> BH["Peroxisome Turnover (Pexophagy)"]
    BH --> BG


